<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Beneficial reduced. [corrected 18:50 gmt]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Beneficial reduced. [corrected 18:50 gmt]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan &amp; Co said analyst Michael Freudenstein cut the rating on Beneficial Corp to market perform from buy &quot;as the stock has recently circled our $66 target price.&quot; (Corrects from &quot;constantly circled&quot; to &quot;recently circled&quot;)</p>
<p>-- shares fell 7/8 to 64.</p>
</text>
